+### Git-Based Update (running from source)

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.207274
+When hermes-agent was installed via `git clone` and is behind upstream:

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.252431
+**Before updating — always analyze first:**

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.266593
+```bash

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.300840
+# 1. Check what changed

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.334911
+cd /path/to/hermes-agent

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.365120
+git fetch origin

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.423415
+git log --oneline HEAD..origin/main   # preview total commit count

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.484753
+git log --oneline HEAD..origin/main --stat -- ':!package-lock.json' ':!yarn.lock' | head -60

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.520563
+# 2. Check your local mods won't conflict

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.611644
+git status --short                    # see local changes

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.714526
+git diff HEAD..origin/main -- path/to/modified-file.py  # check upstream touched YOUR files

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.737753
+# 3. Categorize upstream changes

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.811635
+git log --oneline HEAD..origin/main --grep="CVE\|security\|vuln"     # security

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.873434
+git log --oneline HEAD..origin/main --grep="fix" -- agent/ gateway/ tools/  # fixes

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.941384
+git log --oneline HEAD..origin/main --grep="feat" -- agent/ hermes_cli/     # features

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.948720
+```

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.976912
+**Safe update with local modifications:**

# 2026-06-17 14:49:59.986912
+```bash

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.038746
+git stash -u -m "pre-update-$(date +%Y-%m-%d)"    # save local mods

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.107314
+git pull --ff-only origin main                      # fast-forward only (no merge commits)

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.159174
+git stash pop                                       # restore local mods

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.210485
+uv sync                                             # update dependencies

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.218482
+```

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.240254
+**Post-update verification:**

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.249788
+```bash

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.262786
+# Core imports

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.343025
+python -c "import agent.conversation_loop, agent.tool_executor, tools.terminal_tool, tools.file_tools; print('OK')"

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.353597
+# Scripts

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.452568
+python -c "import sys; sys.path.insert(0, 'scripts'); from auto_recall import recall_for_session; from hermes_hooks import get_hooks; print('OK')"

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.461677
+# CLI

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.542783
+python hermes_cli/main.py --help | head -5

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.565800
+# Update version cache

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.645762
+echo '{"behind": 0, "ver": "'$(git describe --tags --always)'"}' > ../.update_check

# 2026-06-17 14:50:00.652854
